{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：S01和S05停留时间较短，Y的部分感受句偏长，可能来不及吸收全部细节；X的短词在局部更容易一眼扫过。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y把关键心理变化放大加亮，话与感受上下对应，不必像X那样在长句和大量短词之间来回寻找关系；即使没读完，也容易抓住每段的转折和原因。Y的感受往往有具体的身体反应、场景和音乐出现时机，能让人感到喜欢、克制、害怕失去之间的细微差别，而不是只接收到情绪标签。反复出现的水波、小船、呼吸和没说出口的话，也把从最初不敢表露到最后不再隐藏的过程连成了一件事。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "68833d8e-5f6e-462e-966d-0149358246c6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T030741142795Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:08:17.945271+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0c5d25e9256fe36c9e5a4aef2a182ba91fb96e7402380ff45c522ff22cc83a22", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}